    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Dino Party, a wild multiplayer brawler where friendships are tested, and buildings don\u2019t last long. Battle through a series of unpredictable minigames, punch your friends into oblivion, and tear down the arena in fully physics-driven destruction. Play online or locally\u2014just be ready for absolute mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Seamless Minigame Mayhem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience non-stop action as the stadium morphs seamlessly between explosive minigames. Whether you\u2019re teaming up for 2v2 soccer brawls, dodging crumbling lava floors, or surviving a frantic game of hot potato, every match throws unpredictable hazards. No two rounds are ever alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/16fed4371258397ef1d2725761c73e95.poster.avif?t=1752668917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/16fed4371258397ef1d2725761c73e95.webm?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/16fed4371258397ef1d2725761c73e95.mp4?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Punch First, Ask Questions Later</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two buttons. Endless chaos. String together punch combos to yeet rivals off cliffs, shield at the perfect moment to avoid disaster, or unleash the dreaded Assbomb\u2122 (a butt-stomp so powerful, it\u2019s legally required to yell \u201cBOOM\u201d when you land). Whether you\u2019re a strategic shield-master or a button-mashing maniac, everyone gets to wreak havoc!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/8da1a550b7779916f9a81c3e8800ac28.poster.avif?t=1752668917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/8da1a550b7779916f9a81c3e8800ac28.webm?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/8da1a550b7779916f9a81c3e8800ac28.mp4?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Inner Dino</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, you just want to let loose and wreck everything in sight. Smash through walls and watch entire floors collapse with physics-driven destruction that feels as satisfying as it sounds. Embrace your inner beast and turn the arena into your personal demolition zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/50411714caefa7b7cfaecf7df7427ab6.poster.avif?t=1752668917\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/50411714caefa7b7cfaecf7df7427ab6.webm?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/50411714caefa7b7cfaecf7df7427ab6.mp4?t=1752668917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete in Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who says dinosaurs can\u2019t be stylish? Mix colors, patterns, and body-part cosmetics (robot tail? lava horns?) to create a creature that\u2019s uniquely yours\u2014then humble your friends with both your skills and your flawless dino-drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1939390/extras/1a94b13759588e9a18ad929dd2bf88fc.avif?t=1752668917\" /></div></p>",
